# Normalize line endings: store LF in the repository and check out LF on every
# platform. Without this, Windows clones get CRLF via core.autocrlf while
# .prettierrc sets endOfLine "lf", which produced ~25,000 spurious
# "Delete CR" errors from prettier/prettier and made `npm run lint` useless.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never normalize
*.png binary
*.ico binary
